  "prompt": "What is the average order value for each country that orders ship to? An order's value is the sum, over its order lines, of quantity times unit_price_eur minus line_discount_eur, and ship_to_country is the order's country. Average over the orders that have at least one line. Return two columns, in this order: ship_to_country and avg_order_eur. Return one row for each country. Do not round. Any row order is fine.",
